--workspace {workspace} --check-all OTHERWISE (Fallback): for f in $(find {workspace} -name "*.yaml"); do echo "=== $f ==="; cat "$f"; done > /tmp/analyst_fallback.txt 4. Consolidate all results → a Report

## Procedure HARDEN_CHECK

